{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Premise validated: TEST-SIDE, not an emitter regression.\n\nThe OK: suppression is deliberate and documented. __main__.py guards the OK: summary block with 'route not in {\"preview\",\"sync\"}'; docs/exit-codes.md section 'Bridge routes: canonical 0/1/2' pins the canonical benign states to a single stderr line (BRIDGE_STATE: converged), and ADR 0092 records the compatibility adapters. c87afedba8 re-pointed the two cells at sync, so they began asserting on output the invoked route never prints. No src/rebar change was warranted.\n\nOne correction to the fix as filed. The ticket proposed asserting BRIDGE_STATE: converged plus zero differ totals; the converged half alone is NOT zero-write evidence, because __main__.py classifies a pass that applied N mutations as CONVERGED too (only mutation_failures > 0 downgrades it to OPERATIONAL_FAILURE). A one-for-one swap onto that line would have left test_a_repeated_dc_reconcile_pass_writes_nothing green while a pass thrashed the remote on every run, which is exactly what it exists to catch. So the idempotence assertion now also requires both RECON differ totals to be present and zero (run_differs.py) and zero per-mutation 'RECON: batch_outcome' lines (applier.py). Those are bare print(file=sys.stderr) calls, not logging calls, so they need no REBAR_LOG_LEVEL cooperation.\n\nParsing moved into a dependency-free tests/external/live_jira_dc/_bridge_output.py so tests/unit/test_bridge_output_parsing.py can prove it in the ordinary unit lane (11 cases, passing locally, no Jira/network/credentials). The live cells themselves can only be exercised by CI's external lane, so their green is deferred to the Verified gate per the last acceptance criterion.\n\nChange: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1653"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786529089964373001,"uuid":"638a76ad-0e66-42c3-933f-2fe16e0ea3e3"}